        "id": 1000480
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-16T10:14:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if this was always in the spec, or if we added it much later resulting in Dawn being non-spec compliant.",
      "parentUuid": "a9335ef5_172b283b",
      "revId": "f764f8c7807d133d318ad8096f7183d116945eeb",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
