        "id": 1000480
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-23T09:23:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "By the way, what would be a nice way to make sure `CreateDevice()` from https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:gpu/command_buffer/service/shared_image/iosurface_image_backing_factory_unittest.cc;l\u003d450;drc\u003d0c971b731b7cf9416fc197d56ecbd685dedd0194 gets a device from different adapters. Shall we use the extension struct or is there a way to get 3 different adapters?",
      "parentUuid": "fd9338a6_15cd613b",
      "revId": "f764f8c7807d133d318ad8096f7183d116945eeb",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
